Prebuilt tools (statically linked)
==================================

Debug/utility tools for arm64 targets.

Prebuilt from Rockchip Buildroot 2026 SDK with kernel 6.12:
90bd4166 tools: Update memtester

Using rockchip_tools_{arm32,arm64,riscv64}_defconfig.

For building kmsgrab:
1/ ./build.sh shell
2/ source ./buildroot/output/$RK_BUILDROOT_CFG/host/environment-setup
3/ $CC $RK_DATA_DIR/kmsgrab.c $(pkg-config --cflags --libs libdrm) -static -o kmsgrab

External sources:
1/ rkwifibt:
6ecf1cc rk960: bt: update firmware and runtime init flow
2/ rktoolkit:
5d6b578 vuart_console: add version 2.0 struct
